  "request": "Issue #455. Goal: migrate the six named historical regression scenarios from the deleted buildAcceptanceReviewArtifactFromEvidence export to the current public production acceptance-review artifact writer, validation, and evidence-binding lifecycle. Scope: specs 290, 293, 295, 296, 301, and 310 regression files; preserve verdict policy, deferred finding, producer contract, retry exhaustion, no-tests state, and post-hook deferral semantics; make all six complete regression files pass. Out of scope: compatibility export or shim, acceptance-review lifecycle redesign, Issue #443 changes, and test-only paths production cannot reach. If a scenario reveals a current product defect, keep the scenario strong and separate that defect as another BUG.",
